      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but u mentioned the new jobs are \"expected\" to offset the losses... honestly that sounds like a bit of a reach to me. wouldn't the immediate disruption to the energy market and the massive cost of transitioning basically guarantee a recession before any green jobs even materialize? it feels like the risks are way more concrete than the benefits.",
